      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(a) With maximum feasible parent and community participation, responsibility for developing, planning, administering, operating, contracting, coordinating, supporting, monitoring and evaluating, programs providing for day care and child development services. In connection therewith, the Commissioner shall have the power to enter into contracts to perform such services, receive and administer funds from federal, state or local agencies or public and private sources and to determine, in accordance with applicable provisions of law, which public or private programs should ultimately receive such funds. The Commissioner shall administer on behalf of the City, when permitted by applicable federal, state and local law;",
